OL,3,GNEWSALib Dems call on regional mayor to
OL,4,Afranchise buses
OL,5,
OL,6,FLiberal Democrat council leaders are
OL,7,Fcalling on the West of England mayor to
OL,8,Fset out a timetable for bringing buses
OL,9,Fback under public control.
OL,11,FA franchising model would mean the West
OL,12,Fof England combined authority (Weca)
OL,13,Fsets routes and timetables, with
OL,14,Foperators bidding to run the service.
OL,16,FGodwin said she is considering it as
OL,17,Fone option for the long-term, but
OL,18,Fargued it would mean an additional
OL,19,Fcharge on top of people's council tax
OL,20,Fbills, which she is not willing to
OL,21,Fintroduce in the next three years.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
