OL,3,GNEWSALib Dems call on regional mayor to
OL,4,Afranchise buses
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Kevin Guy, who leads Bath
OL,7,Fand North Somerset council, said Godwin
OL,8,Fshould "get on with it".
